1. She is a celestial messenger who has lost her wings and is waiting for her banana to regain power. (Verbatim: "Yeah, I'm a celestial messenger, but as you can see, I haven't regained the power of my wings. I have the banana, but the banana hasn't reached full power yet, so I don't have my wings.")

2. She attended primary school in England, which goes up to around age 10 or 11. (Verbatim: "Yeah, up to 11? Yeah, up to like 10, 11.")

3. During primary school, she was given the responsibility of using the paper guillotine, earning her the nickname "guillotine girl." (Verbatim: "I was the guillotine girl. I remember I had special responsibility.")

4. She has a history of leg issues, including tendinitis and a ligament that is too short, contributing to flat feet. (Verbatim: "Technically I have issues with my legs where the ligament of the bottom part is too short... it's technically flat feet and that it just like kind of goes down because the ligament's too short or something.")

5. She was team captain for her school netball team and continued playing despite being told by a doctor to avoid exercise, which worsened her injury. (Verbatim: "I got tendinitis when I was having like um back in school I got tendinitis and the doctor was like Elia Elia no exercise and I was like hmm but I'm playing netball and I was team captain so I played and then ruined it.")

6. After being forced to stop exercising, she began watching a lot more anime and picked up game development as a hobby. (Verbatim: "what a coincidence that was when I had to stop the exercise I started watching a hecking ton more anime... that was actually the time I started picking up the um hobby of game development.")

7. She created an anime-style biology teaching game to help her study, featuring a character explaining ecological succession. (Verbatim: "I actually made a um biology an anime biology teaching game yeah it had like this anime character teaching you about like ecological succession.")

8. She lost all progress on her game development project when her laptop died and she had not backed up her files. (Verbatim: "that laptop just full-on died it and then i lost everything... it was all gone like all all of it gone the whole thing like so much so much work disappeared that day.")

9. She strongly emphasizes the importance of backing up files and saving work frequently, especially after her personal experience with data loss. (Verbatim: "the lesson of if you have any kind of big project back it up back up the files i beg you back up the files back them up.")

10. While writing her university dissertation, she experienced frequent power cuts in her student halls, often triggered by using the oven clock. (Verbatim: "the amount of times um i thought like power cuts in my student halls was too many mostly because there was a very specific thing you could do to like trigger a power cut which was to use the clock on the oven.") [end of text]



1. Her online name was initially going to be "Stellaris," but she changed it because it is the name of a video game. (Verbatim: "originally it was gonna be like stellaris and then i was like no wait that's a game i can't yeah")

2. She created her online identity quickly and under time pressure, describing it as rushed. (Verbatim: "my name was just really really really quickly thought all of it all of it was very much rushed scuff city")

3. She prides herself on organizing and coordinating creative projects, such as finding artists under tight deadlines. (Verbatim: "i went into overdrive overclocked my brain for y'all and did a lot of organizing and a lot of sorting out of stuffs like the like finding artists and things as quick as i could")

4. She identifies as a procrastinator and claims she thrives under pressure. (Verbatim: "i'm quite a last minute person anyway so that does help i thrive under pressure like anyone that's a procrastinator")

5. She played League of Legends extensively in the past and still has it installed on her computer. (Verbatim: "i'll be honest i still have this league of legends on my pc i've never uninstalled it ever")

6. She struggled with guilt over playing games during her student years, especially before exams. (Verbatim: "i can't wait to get my exams out the way so i can play games without the guilt because any games played prior to the exam were just games played with guilt")

7. She once had a negative experience playing League of Legends where she lost 20 games in a row while procrastinating. (Verbatim: "that one day i procrastinated play legal day and lost 20 games in a row that was an awful day")

8. She values self-kindness and emphasizes it as a core personal principle, even more than self-love. (Verbatim: "be kind to yourself is what i meant kind to yourself... being like oh i'm dumb i'm this i'm not no you need to be kind to yourself first")

9. She believes in empathy and acknowledges that people's hardships are often invisible. (Verbatim: "hardships you don't know people's hardships and it's impossible to fully imagine somebody's full life")

10. She references philosophical ideas, such as Descartes’ "I think therefore I am," in discussions about self-awareness and understanding others. (Verbatim: "i think therefore i am and if i extend upon that the only thing you can be certain of is your own thoughts") [end of text]



1. She studied Chinese in her final year of school instead of Latin, but the teacher didn't know how to speak it. (Verbatim: "in my school they wanted to try and well they had a choice in the final year between latin or chinese so i did not pick latin i picked chinese but the teacher didn't know how to speak chinese so that was pointless waste of time")

2. She has a habit of waking up at 4 a.m. with creative ideas and often writes them down. (Verbatim: "i wake up at 4 a.m and then i think of something and then and then i um then i write write out stuff and ideas most of my ideas come at like 4 a.m yeah 4 a.m is a good time for thoughts")

3. She sings in the shower and has multiple mood-based shower playlists. (Verbatim: "i have a shower playlist i have a couple of shower playlists depending on my mood")

4. She once spent three months in a jungle environment collecting data, which involved long walks and difficult terrain. (Verbatim: "alien in the jungle was like um not that not that like this this one it was pretty much like this for like a permanent three months of this")

5. During her time in the jungle, she avoided grabbing a thorny vine while balancing on a slippery ledge, relying on finger strength developed from gaming. (Verbatim: "i got my thumb and my index finger and held that by where the thorns were... that's when all them years training playing video game came in handy from strong finger hand time power")

6. She was chased by a giant monkey in the jungle after it was attracted to fruit in the kitchen area. (Verbatim: "that's how we ended up with getting chased by the giant monkey like the giant monkey oh gosh oh gosh like the giant monkey chased because it went after the fruit that was in the kitchen area")

7. She finds it difficult to express her happiness with words and sometimes creates keyboard mash expressions on Twitter. (Verbatim: "words can't explain it words aren't sufficient for me... that's why i usually just push my keyboard on twitter")

8. She considers her brain to be in "permanent overdrive" thinking of ways to make content and experiences better for her audience. (Verbatim: "my brain's permanently thinking that i think i need to get like a notepad or something so i can write it down")

9. She does not get angry often and tends to become emotional instead of enraged. (Verbatim: "i don't get angry very often usually my brain will come up with a dream to help me deal with anger... i just end up getting all cryy but any rage any rage doesn't exist")

10. She aspires to create a game and have another VTuber, Nura Sama, play it. (Verbatim: "what would be cool is if i can make that game and then and then have the a have have nura sama play it that would be cool") [end of text]



1. She was raised by parents who often told her to shut up, making her feel her voice was annoying. (Verbatim: "As someone who was raised always being told to shut up by her parents... I always thought I must have had quite an annoying voice.")

2. She struggled with being mute and overthinking in school due to social anxiety. (Verbatim: "being quite mute back in school... I was mostly mute because I just overthought everything that I was gonna say.")

3. She finds it difficult to speak in real-time conversations and often overthinks her words afterward. (Verbatim: "that night actually like think back to everything I said and then cringe at myself and worry... run through everything you did wrong today.")

4. She has a habit of post-thinking and worrying about whether her words may have upset others. (Verbatim: "do the thing like post think and think about all the conversations I had that day and be like wait did I say that right did that upset them.")

5. She reassures herself by believing her intentions are kind, even if misinterpreted. (Verbatim: "although someone may have misinterpreted my words my intentions still remain and my intentions were still kind.")

6. She once did a long trek followed by a 50-minute walk to a restaurant, which caused foot pain. (Verbatim: "yesterday I went on that that ridiculously long trek... the food place... is over 50 minutes like five zero.")

7. She has an unintentionally angry facial expression, even when not actually angry. (Verbatim: "it doesn't help that I can have an angie face... I'm not angry at anything I'm just angry at my foot.")

8. She wants to improve her streaming by watching and analyzing her own past streams. (Verbatim: "to get to improve myself at streaming... I have to watch myself to see how I am.")

9. She aims to remove the mental gate between her thoughts and speech to be more expressive. (Verbatim: "I hadn't removed that gate between my brain and my mouth... now you get to hear all my dumb dumb thoughts.")

10. She hopes to release chibi model files for fans once she becomes monetized. (Verbatim: "When I get monetized you will get the chippies you will the chippies yeah yeah soon soon.") [end of text]



1. She was a celestial messenger in the stars before being reincarnated on Earth. (Verbatim: "maybe you knew me when i was a celestial messenger back up in the stars before i tried to come down to earth and and got reincarnated maybe maybe")

