8. She dislikes the idea of banana pizza and doesn’t have high hopes for it, but is open to trying it someday. (Verbatim: "i don't have high hopes for banana pizza but i guess it should be tried")

9. She plans to use PNGs of her model for future collabs with other VTubers to have matching appearances. (Verbatim: "you'll see we um probably use the pngs when we do when i do a collab with my buddies because then we'd all be matching")

10. She identifies with British cultural traits, such as following queues and order. (Verbatim: "we's british we gotta follow the order the order") [end of text]



1. She is a celestial messenger who fell from the sky and died ("got unalived") before being reincarnated on Earth. (Verbatim: "You weren't celestial messengers that traveled to Earth and tripped on air and then fell.")  
2. She was reincarnated as a half-British, half-Asian girl. (Verbatim: "And then I got reincarnated as a half-British, half-Asian girl and was like... Yabba!")  
3. Her primary goal is to make people happy and bring joy, comfort, and wholesome experiences to her audience. (Verbatim: "All I want to do is make people happy. And I don't think that's a bad thing to want to do.")  
4. She believes that her own happiness comes from making others happy. (Verbatim: "And then I'm happy if everyone else is happy.")  
5. She has a fictional connection to a "magic banana" and uses it as a whimsical explanation for game mechanics or plot points. (Verbatim: "It's magic. That's the best solution to any plot hole.")  
6. She dislikes exploitative game monetization models such as pay-to-win, DLCs, and tiered access. (Verbatim: "I don't like that kind of stuff. So no, it's going to just be free.")  
7. She had a strange or quirky childhood, recalling a photo of herself at about three years old making a weird pose next to a bunny rabbit. (Verbatim: "There's another one where I'm like... doing this weird pose towards it and I don't know why.")  
8. She traveled to "Asialand" as a baby and has an old passport from that time. (Verbatim: "I had to fly to asialand as a baby and um yeah... I still have somewhere baby picture.")  
9. She finds it difficult to express certain words, such as "nourished," and jokes about her brain not working properly. (Verbatim: "Oh, my brain no worky.")  
10. She blames her childhood oddness on not having her "magic banana and celestial messenger powers" back then. (Verbatim: "Maybe it's because I didn't have my magic banana and celestial messenger powers.") [end of text]



